Ownership is concentrated but not one-person. I ran `git blame` on every line of the repo's own Go code and ignored vendored dependencies. Blame followed code moved between files, ignored whitespace changes, and used the repo's `.git-blame-ignore-revs`. The total is 1,657 live lines.

