I ran `git blame` at HEAD on the 6 Go files the project owns: 1,657 lines in total. I excluded `vendor/`, which is third-party code, and the whitespace and `interface{}`→`any` commits in `.git-blame-ignore-revs`. I merged contributors by email address.

| Rank | Author | Lines | Share |
